          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Flexible Service Solutions</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We offer flexible service solutions tailored to meet your facility’s needs. From preventative maintenance visits, a repair focused service plan or customized billing options - together we’ll design a solution that works best for your facility.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
