          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Original Equipment Manufacturer Quality and Reliability</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker is the sole provider of OEM parts, components and product specifications. We maintain and service our products per Stryker original specifications and quality standards to ensure our focus is on patient safety, device reliability and performance resulting in maximized uptime.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
