          "jcr:created": "Wed Dec 12 2018 19:24:38 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Specialized support from Stryker Certified Technicians</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Proactive care, maintenance and device repair delivered by our expert team of service professionals both in your facility and at our repair depot in Flower Mound, TX. Only our certified technicians are equipped with the proprietary device knowledge, training and genuine Stryker parts to deliver patent safety, device reliability and performance.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
